    family-names: Sharma
    affiliation: "SASWE, Department of Civil and Environmental Engineering, University of Washington"
repository-code: "https://github.com/UW-SASWE/swot-reservoir-storage"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-09"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23270630"
abstract: >-
  Code for three analyses quantifying what the Surface Water and Ocean Topography (SWOT)
  mission adds to reservoir storage monitoring: SWOTNOW, a present-day storage estimator
  using no in-situ input; SWOTRACE, a monthly storage-anomaly reconstruction for 1984-2021;
  and a propagation of per-reservoir error to an uncertainty on globally summed storage.
